    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ef1e9551a4e4150aa99a90</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 06:28:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvdTpGy2vfxWj-msIq_zNLqy1Mo2.jpeg"></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>家庭作业｜从《大唐漠北》到《内外·感觉你感觉爱》，聊聊我们身边的广告</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gE411r7wv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gE411r7wv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> </span></strong></a><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gE411r7wv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gE411r7wv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f"><span>大唐漠北的最后一次转账</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>代理公司：上海胜加广告</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>导演及制作公司：丁雨晨/37Film</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>传播公司：上海凡人互动广告</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>客户：中国银联·云闪付</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本片筹备长达四个月时间，视频制作团队的每个人都突破了人类的生理极限。但每个人都觉得，去讲让人热血沸腾的故事，是一件很燃很燃的事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（丁雨晨导演yyds）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img alt="做广告，多么让人骄傲" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9maWxlLmRpZ2l0YWxpbmcuY29tL2VJbWcvdWltYWdlcy8yMDE5MDgyNy8xNTY2ODcxOTU1OTg0NTY4LnBuZw==.png"></p><span></span><p><img alt="做广告，多么让人骄傲" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9maWxlLmRpZ2l0YWxpbmcuY29tL2VJbWcvdWltYWdlcy8yMDE5MDgyNy8xNTY2ODcxOTkxNjk5NjUxLnBuZw==.png"></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qC4y1t73e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qC4y1t73e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> </span></strong></a><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qC4y1t73e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qC4y1t73e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>不在乎天长地久，只在乎曾经拥有</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>代理公司：朱家鼎及其创意团队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>导演及制作公司：未知</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>传播公司：未知</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>客户：铁时达手表</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>当时，朱家鼎及其创意团队围绕铁达时手表古典怀旧的特点，首次选用电影化表现手法，通过“战争与爱情”的题材视角赋予铁达时手表品牌更多的情感魅力。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>广告虽然走马灯变换着梅艳芳、周润发，刘德华等明星，但唯一不变的就是这句现在看来似乎满满玛丽苏情怀的广告词。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL21tYml6X2pwZy9nSU9BMmtpYVZic0s1TTltYmVlU2czdmdyTHFpY2hBaWJyT3JoVWNiSE9odTVEdnd5SjJHYjRoS0gySXlaTTVhaDRsWE80aWN2ekZIRnJGZTBnZmhnT1RPelEvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1qcGVnJnd4ZnJvbT01Jnd4X2xhenk9MSZ3eF9jbz0x"></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/862917.html" data-url="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/862917.html"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> </span></a><a href="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/862917.html" data-url="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/862917.html"><span>瑞幸x何广智</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>代理公司：无，品牌方自制</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>短代艺人：何广智</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>瑞幸与卡通IP线条小狗联名</span></strong><span>，推出情人节特饮《修狗爱情故事》，更令人惊喜的是，瑞幸响应粉丝们的热情安利，今天早上官宣</span><strong><span>带刺玫瑰何广智和带刺玫瑰拿铁相认了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9maWxlLmRpZ2l0YWxpbmcuY29tL2VJbWcvdWltYWdlcy8yMDIzMDIxMy8xNjc2MjU3OTA4MzEyMTA0LmpwZw==.jpg"></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.digitaling.com/projects/236830.html" data-url="https://www.digitaling.com/projects/236830.html"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> </span></a><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aT41197Ct/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aT41197Ct/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d076676a54cdabe98a58d1540589181f"><span>内外·感觉你感觉爱</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>代理公司：内外（品牌方自制）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>在情人节来临之际，内外推出了新品 LOVE 系列情侣内裤。就像内裤和我们日复一日24小时的陪伴，那些轻盈的、贴合的、柔软的感觉也许隐秘、细微且因人而异，但都被我们的感官全盘接收。因此，</span><strong><span>为了让人们在看似琐碎的日常中，去感受、捕捉、保留幸福，并探寻属于自己的舒适，内外发布了短片《感觉你感觉爱》。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img alt="1675739851487835.jpg" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9maWxlLmRpZ2l0YWxpbmcuY29tL2VJbWcvdWltYWdlcy8yMDIzMDIwNy8xNjc1NzM5ODUxNDg3ODM1LmpwZw==.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>同时，欢迎大家去收看内外x冈本赞助的姜思达《DV计划》新一期，姜思达x马思纯的深度访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上，就是我们第一期家庭作业的全部案例整合，感谢收看。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>幕后制作</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主播：Sera &nbsp;｜ Kiwi</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>设计：滚笑海菠萝｜Kiwi</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后期：Kiwi</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>编辑：Sera</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>关于节目</span></h2><span></span><p><span>「不能停更」是一档独立播客。由漂泊在魔都的两个有趣的灵魂创建，致在填补你耳边的空闲时间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容多变，风格不定，唯一的宗旨就是，不能停更，激励我们自己，同时也希望可以激励到每一只耳朵，不论如何，记得不能停更。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于我们</span></h2><span></span><p><span>感谢收听「不能停更」，如果你对于本期节目有任何的看法或建议，或者希望能够来「不能停更」聊一聊，我们期待你给我们写信，让我们步履不停。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱地址是：serajiao9512@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
